Header-free distillation of libc++'s <__tuple/tuple_size.h>; found
while diagnosing the bodiless std::tuple constructor (the tuple_size
mis-selection made _SameSize=false, sending __make_tuple_types into
the heavy flat machinery and the ctor conversion into a recursion
error).
